# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS. Prettier (eslint) rejects CRLF, and CRLF
# in entrypoint.sh breaks the shebang inside the Linux container. Without this,
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files out as CRLF and `docker compose build` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
